There are some matches here.
An old-timer with one eye missing and no money for a drink sits at the bar.
>-: Kissed.
The old man blushes.
>-: coins:
Given.
He fingers the coins for a moment and then looks up agape.  `Kind you are and
I mean to repay you as best I can.'  Grabbing a pencil and cocktail napkin...

